@startuml kairos-reports-dashboard-and-export-reports-sequence
title View Reports Dashboard and Export

actor Admin
participant "Web Admin" as WebAdmin
participant "Kairos API" as API
participant "DB" as DB
participant "BI" as BI

Admin -> WebAdmin: Open Reports Dashboard
WebAdmin -> API: GET /reports/summary
API -> DB: Aggregate attendance, membership growth,\nevangelism, giving
DB --> API: metrics
API --> WebAdmin: 200 OK {metrics}

WebAdmin -> BI: Load embedded Power BI report
BI --> WebAdmin: report visuals

Admin -> WebAdmin: Click "Export Summary"
WebAdmin -> API: GET /reports/export?type=summary&format=PDF
API -> DB: Re-run summary query
DB --> API: data
API --> WebAdmin: Generated file
WebAdmin --> Admin: Download file

@enduml
